CAUTION FOR FLIGHT:

RGB-D odometry can fail in:
- plain floor
- plain wall
- dark area
- reflective surface
- glass
- sunlight
- fast motion
- vibration
- low texture

For better tracking, camera should see:
- features
- corners
- texture
- boxes
- printed paper
- posters
- AprilTags or visual markers
- non-reflective objects


